sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Agency user
    participant P as Agency panel
    participant A as Core: Auth module
    participant C as ARcaptcha
    participant Y as Yaghut
    participant DB as Oracle
    U->>P: internet-bank username, password, captcha
    P->>A: POST /api/auth/agency/login
    A->>C: verify token (agency keys)
    C-->>A: success true
    A->>Y: POST /user/loginStatic {username, password}
    alt credentials wrong, suspected customer, or service access denied
        Y-->>A: success false, exception
        A-->>P: refused with the matching Persian message
    end
    Y-->>A: Set-Cookie JSESSIONID, sessionExpirationDate, cif, temporarySessionId, passwordExpirationBean
    Note over A: Refuse if no JSESSIONID, temporary session, or expired password
    A->>DB: find agency by cif
    alt no agency with this cif
        A-->>P: refused, agency not registered in Asan Zeman
    end
    A->>DB: store JSESSIONID + expiry with the Asan Zeman session (server side)
    A-->>P: access token 15 min + refresh token, capped at the earlier of 8 h and Yaghut expiry
